// standing "CarPlay matches the phone" rule.
// CPListItem takes a UIImage through the same [RCTConvert UIImage:] data-URI path as the
// map buttons (parseListItems in RCTConvert+RNCarPlay.m), so these are OTA-able too.
// Regenerate: swift glyph.swift <Ionicons.ttf> <hex codepoint> 132 out.png, then base64.
